# Generated by `code-review-graph install`, which registers the MCP server and
# writes its instructions into every AI assistant it can find. AGENTS.md,
# .cursorrules, .windsurfrules and .kiro/steering/code-review-graph.md were all
# byte-identical copies of one blurb; the skills under .claude/ and .codebuddy/
# only drive its tools and do nothing without the server. Local dev tooling, not
# project source - CLAUDE.md and .code-review-graph/ above are ignored for the
# same reason. Kept on disk; only untracked.
AGENTS.md
.kiro/
.cursorrules
.windsurfrules
